<title>UK: Sallie Mae prices $500mln 3-yr callable bond.</title>
<headline>Sallie Mae prices $500mln 3-yr callable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and Morgan Stanley International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STUDENT LOAN MARKETING ASSOCIATION</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     6.16	MATURITY   *02.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    02.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.15	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+39 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC   0.10</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT U.S. TREASURY DUE NOVEMBER 1999</p>
<p> NOTES	*CALLABLE AFTER ONE YEAR</p>
<p>		 ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
